    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Level 18 — <strong>Eye of the Storm</strong></h2><p>You become the still point.</p><h3>Once per Soma Break</h3><p>For 1 minute, in a 4 squares radius:</p><ul><li><p>Burn does not increase for you or allies</p></li><li><p>Fear, charm, and fear effects are suppressed</p></li><li><p>Ongoing emotional effects are paused</p></li></ul><p>After the effect ends:</p><ul><li><p>You gain <strong>1 Burn</strong></p></li></ul><p>Violence happens around you.<br />It does not take you.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
